# ============================================================
#  NYXUS — wallpaper rotation set
#  ~/.config/nyxus/wall-rotation.list
#
#  ONLY these wallpapers rotate across the desktop background, the lock
#  screen, and the login screen (nyxus-rotate-walls reads this file).
#  Curated to the alien art, the "NYXUS HYPRLAND" scene, and the
#  sierengowski walls — nothing else.
#
#  One wallpaper SLUG per line (the filename without .png). A slug must
#  resolve to a file in ~/.config/hypr/walls/ or
#  /usr/share/backgrounds/nyxus/. Anything after a '#' is a comment.
#  Add a line to include a wall; delete/comment one to drop it.
#
#  NOTE: a couple of these were categorized by filename since the art
#  couldn't be previewed here — trim any that don't fit the vibe.
#  © 2026 JOSEPH A. SIERENGOWSKI · NYX-J5W-2026-SIERENGOWSKI-LOCKED
# ============================================================

nyxus-urban-alien           # alien
nyxus-demon                 # alien
nyxus-hacker-mode-a         # alien / hacker matrix
nyxus-hacker-mode-b         # alien / hacker matrix
nyxus-kageryu-blackout      # alien / Kage Ryu blackout
nyxus-login-wall            # the "NYXUS HYPRLAND CUSTOMS" alien shop scene
nyxus-desktop-hero          # NYXUS alien hero scene
nyxus-frost-sierengowski    # sierengowski
nyxus-sierengowski-clean    # sierengowski
